Third-party code
----------------

Selected infrastructure code is derived from rhizome-mcp
(https://github.com/Odrin/rhizome-mcp), Copyright rhizome-mcp contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, obtained via the proof of
concept boboty/agent-board-rhizome-poc (commit bc7f88d). Derived files carry a
header naming their origin and have been modified:

  internal/clock/clock.go          injectable UTC clock
  internal/ids/ids.go              ULID generation and strict parsing
  internal/domain/errors.go        structured error type (codes are Agent Board's own)
  internal/sqlite/sqlite.go        SQLite open, WAL and PRAGMA configuration
  internal/sqlite/transaction.go   BEGIN IMMEDIATE writes, BUSY retry, snapshot reads
  internal/sqlite/errors.go        SQLite error translation
  internal/sqlite/timestamps.go    fixed-width UTC timestamp storage format
  migrations/migrations.go         checksummed migration runner
  internal/projectconfig/projectconfig.go
                                   project identity file and external data path

Only infrastructure was derived. No workflow, issue state machine, attempt,
lease, review, or gate semantics were taken from rhizome-mcp.
